You must be bored, looking for pages that aren't supposed to
be here. Newbie Guide Book written by Sargoth Neevosaiden,
a.k.a. Maelstrome Neevosaiden.
 
I hope that you have found this guide useful, if you have
any questions please feel free to ask.

