#111
The Grand Training Barracks~
Weapon racks and practice dummies line the walls of this spacious training
hall. The Master-at-Arms oversees drills here. Stairs lead up to the Central
Temple, the Healer's Sanctum lies east, and the Questmaster's Office is west.
~
