#250
The Threshold of Awakening~
A crystalline platform hangs suspended in an endless expanse of swirling
cerulean fog. Pillars of polished quartz rise at the four corners, inscribed
with pulsing runes that catch the light. A carved guide post stands beside the
path, offering guidance to those newly arrived in the World of Darkness. The
ethereal mist coalesces northward into an illuminated grand hallway.
~
