pillars pillar quartz~
Four massive quartz pillars anchor the platform against the void. Each is
etched with fundamental directives for the wayfarer:
  {W[1] Perception:{x Type {Y'look'{x to examine your surroundings and objects.
  {W[2] Movement:{x Type {Y'n', 's', 'e', 'w', 'u', 'd'{x to traverse exits.
  {W[3] Discourse:{x Type {Y'say <text>'{x to speak with nearby guides.
  {W[4] Awareness:{x Type {Y'score'{x or {Y'worth'{x to view vitality and coin.
~
