#251
The Hall of Forms~
Crystalline displays line the walls of this vaulted gallery, each hovering
before a towering mirror of silvered glass. Pages of ethereal script shimmer
in mid-air, detailing the nine core Attributes, thirty mortal Abilities, and
the supernatural traits that govern Kindred, Garou, and Awakened souls. A
tall guide post rests beside a display lectern. The path extends north into
the Chamber of Creation, while the Threshold lies south.
~
