sheet charsheet traits~
Haven of the Embraced uses White Wolf's 1-to-5 dot Storyteller system:
  {WAttributes (1-5):{x Raw innate capability (e.g. Strength, Wits).
  {WAbilities (0-5):{x Trained proficiencies (e.g. Brawl, Stealth, Occult).
  {WVirtues (1-5):{x Moral anchors: Conscience, Self-Control, and Courage.
  {WWillpower (1-10):{x Mental grit derived from Courage; fuels powers.
  {WHumanity (0-10):{x The barrier preserving your soul from the Beast.
Type {Y'cs'{x to inspect your active ratings at any time.
~
E
displays mirrors crystalline~
Luminous silver mirrors reflect not physical armor, but the spiritual anatomy
of your character: their demeanor, clan bloodline, disciplines, and rating dots.
~
