#252
The Chamber of Creation~
At the center of this domed pavilion stands a pedestal of white marble bathed
in soft golden lamplight. Vessels of soft sculpting clay and silver calipers
rest on its surface, symbolizing the deliberate molding of identity. A detailed
guide post explains how to craft or adjust a character sheet using Haven's
interactive builder. An arched portal leads north to the Crucible of Essence,
while the Hall of Forms is south.
~
