builder create workflow~
{WInteractive Character Builder ('create' command):{x
  {C1. Priorities:{x Assign 7/5/3 dots to Attributes (Physical/Social/Mental)
     and 13/9/5 dots to Abilities (Talents/Skills/Knowledges).
  {C2. Allocation:{x Type {Y'create <trait> +'{x to raise or {Y'create <trait> -'{x.
  {C3. Virtues:{x Spend 7 dots across Conscience, Self-Control, and Courage.
  {C4. Finalize:{x Once all pools hit 0, type {Y'create done'{x to seal traits!
If you chose an Archetype (0-9), this was pre-set, but you can inspect it anytime.
~
