#253
The Crucible of Essence~
Warm light radiates from floating brazier basins suspended above a floor of
dark polished obsidian. Shimmering points of amber and sapphire light drift
gently through the air, gathering into constellations of mortal Backgrounds
and Freebie essence. A brass guide post stands near the center of the hall.
An open archway continues north to the Spire of Prowess, while the Chamber of
Creation lies south.
~
