#254
The Spire of Prowess~
Racks of training armaments, sparring staves, and arcane diagrams line the
perimeter of this lofty octagonal tower. Star charts overhead map the pathways
between Storyteller attributes and the traditional Diku combat skills. A carved
wooden guide post stands beside a weapon display. A broad stair ascends north
to the Archive of Cycles, while the Crucible of Essence lies south.
~
