E
skillmap skill_map unlocks~
{WHaven's Modern Skill Matrix ('skillmap' command):{x
Unlike traditional MUDs where you spend 'train' or 'practice' sessions at a
guildmaster, Haven unlocks skills dynamically based on your Storyteller sheet:
  - Having sufficient dots in {WAttributes{x (e.g. Dexterity, Wits) or
    {WAbilities{x (e.g. Brawl, Melee, Stealth) unlocks relevant skills.
  - Type {Y'skillmap'{x to browse every skill, its required level, and its
    governing Attribute/Ability dot thresholds.
  - Skills flagged with {rX{x are locked until you raise the required CS trait.
~
E
learning practice improve~
{WSkill Advancement & Mastery:{x
  - Once unlocked, skills start at a base competency.
  - Using a skill in active gameplay (combat, crafting, foraging, stealth)
    rolls checks against your stats. Successful use dynamically increases your
    proficiency toward 100% via the {Wcheck_improve{x engine.
  - Weapons improve with practice; secondary combat skills (blunt, light, heavy)
    raise your weapon proficiency caps.
~
