#255
The Archive of Cycles~
Ribbons of starlight weave through high archways, casting quiet reflections
upon a basin of crystalline water at the room's core. Frescoes on the domed
ceiling depict the endless wheel of life, undeath, rebirth, and ascension: the
mortal walking the street, the Kindred prowling the night, the Garou howling at
the moon, and the Mage rending reality. A bronze guide post stands beside the
reflecting pool. A massive gate leads north to the Grand Crossroads, while the
Spire of Prowess lies south.
~
