remort reincarnation levels~
{WThe Remort System ('remort' command):{x
Upon reaching maximum level ({W100{x), a mortal or supernatural may choose to
undergo Remort:
  - Resets character level to 1, retaining earned fame and accomplishments.
  - Grants additional bonus Freebie points to spend on higher-tier traits.
  - Unlocks higher supernatural paths and bloodline potencies.
~
