#256
The Grand Crossroads of Fate~
You stand at the northern pinnacle of the Prelude upon a magnificent circular
terrace of polished obsidian. Before you stands a grand arched portal swirling
with warm golden light, leading directly into the Central Temple of Recall in
the mortal city. Beside the archway, an iron guide post details the final
divergence between mortal life and the undead curse. The Archive of Cycles lies
to the south.
~
